</div></div></div><div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents" style="min-height:auto"><div><div id="LC154" class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="154" style="position:relative">  2. Basic Permissions.</div></div></div><div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents" style="min-height:auto"><div><div id="LC155" class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="155" style="position:relative">
